    {"type": "text", "id": "code_text", "x": 38, "y": 402, "width": 630, "height": 145, "text": "# greedy: keep guesses while guess == target argmax\n# sampling: keeps the target's distribution exactly\nif random() < min(1, p[x] / q[x]):\n    accept(x)\nelse:\n    x = sample(normalize(max(0, p - q)))", "originalText": "# greedy: keep guesses while guess == target argmax\n# sampling: keeps the target's distribution exactly\nif random() < min(1, p[x] / q[x]):\n    accept(x)\nelse:\n    x = sample(normalize(max(0, p - q)))", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "roughness": 1},

